<title>POLAND: Animex Q2 net rises to PLN 4.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Animex Q2 net rises to PLN 4.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Animex preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.21   vs    1.94</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 5.86   vs    4.84</p>
<p>    net profit			     4.21   vs    3.43</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Animex SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			    147.10   vs  109.76</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     129.78   vs   95.96</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.65   vs    1.41</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   9.14   vs   31.35</p>
<p>    financial costs			8.24   vs   28.45</p>
<p>    investment			    12.12   vs    7.80</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     6.99   vs    6.12</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 9.49   vs    9.52</p>
<p>    net profit			     7.49   vs    7.33</p>
<p>    net sales			    274.58   vs  218.12</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     242.77   vs  190.96</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.01   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.01   vs    2.20</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  20.91   vs   60.23</p>
<p>    financial costs		     18.15   vs   56.83</p>
<p>    investment			    17.18   vs   12.06</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
